/*
 * Top-level orchestrator for macro solving in the Ymir compiler.
 *
 * This module coordinates the entire macro-matching and macro-rewriting
 * pipeline. It is responsible for:
 *
 *   - selecting the correct macro constructor(`MacroCtorSymbol`),
 *   - solving macro rules(`MacroRuleSymbol`),
 *   - applying skip-patterns,
 *   - aggregating and reporting errors,
 *   - computing precise mismatch locations,
 *   - invoking the macro rewriter to produce final expanded content.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::macro_::solve
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/macro_/solve.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2024-09-02
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
